values
  ('capability:admin_capability_registry_ui', 'Capability Registry admin page', 'A real, honest UI (app/admin/(shell)/capabilities/page.tsx) over capability_registry, gated the same way as every other Technical/Beta admin surface (requireReleaseAccess("v2") -- owner-admin + Beta Mode). Groups real rows by status with StatusChip, EmptyState when genuinely empty, ErrorState on a real query failure -- never fabricated/demo rows. First real item toward the mission''s Technical Admin surface (Brain/Agents/Skills/Connections/...); wired into the existing, documented Beta nav group (components/shell/navigation/admin-nav-data.ts, docs/product-design/ADMIN_INFORMATION_ARCHITECTURE.md) rather than inventing a new IA pattern.', 'ecosystem', null, null, 'app/admin/(shell)/capabilities/page.tsx', 'Engineering', null, null, 'read', 'platform_only', 'free', 'read', 'tsc --noEmit clean, lint clean, existing nav/architecture tests re-run clean (v1-stable-beta-architecture, unified-crm-inbox, client-modules-completion, p0-product-boundaries, mission-control)', 'REAL_EXPOSED', 'Discovered the existing admin IA is considerably more mature than assumed: a real, documented (ADMIN_INFORMATION_ARCHITECTURE.md), security-gated Stable/Beta split already exists. This page is the first small, safe addition to it -- not a rebuild. Full Technical Admin (Agents/Skills/Connections/Jobs/Workers/APIs/Deployments/Diagnostics/Recovery as distinct views) remains real future work.', null, now(), 'claude_session_2026-09-02');
